    {"id": 1, "claim": "The doctor's oral instruction to the nurse was not the proximate cause of the patient's death.", "evidence": "The nurse correctly transmitted the order for A-positive blood to the blood bank, and the blood bank staff correctly recorded the order. The error occurred downstream in the blood bank's internal processing and labeling.", "weight": 0.9, "depends_on": []},
